                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "060018e7-aac8-4d32-8003-3573ffa22792",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e4371be-b35c-34f1-8407-1f59b6d389a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "f6c8320a-69c5-3aa5-b88f-dd3f5a7e4267",
                        "target_lang_word": "humanity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humanity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ca511cc-404e-373d-8960-8a0b2d3bee0e",
                                        "entry_id": "f8d4e27d-9df7-3d97-a70d-630d93576862",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Humankind; human beings as a group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a89d32e7-c3b4-4b98-abcf-93a9ce1254b1",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca511cc-404e-373d-8960-8a0b2d3bee0e",
                                                "text": "Then he commenced to talk, really talk. and inside of two flaps of a herring's fin he had me mesmerized, like Eben Holt's boy at the town hall show. He talked about the ills of humanity, and the glories of health and Nature and service and land knows what all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f99198a1-ff5f-4bb3-8695-7a2188a9c00d",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca511cc-404e-373d-8960-8a0b2d3bee0e",
                                                "text": "At last the concourse is relatively clear of humanity and the task of clearing up can begin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "405df05d-3e01-4f0e-b2f1-8be6c44253da",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca511cc-404e-373d-8960-8a0b2d3bee0e",
                                                "text": "It is tempting to speculate about the incentives or compulsions that might explain why anyone would take to the skies in [the] basket [of a balloon]: […]; perhaps to moralise on the oneness or fragility of the planet, or to see humanity for the small and circumscribed thing that it is; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "459a57bb-4c2e-451f-848a-f52062bc8181",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca511cc-404e-373d-8960-8a0b2d3bee0e",
                                                "text": "“The internet”, Eric Schmidt, former chairman of Google, famously observed, “is the first thing that humanity' has built that humanity doesn’t understand, the largest experiment in anarchy that we have ever had.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22040e28-4d98-3e98-855b-53fd64605f7c",
                                        "entry_id": "f8d4e27d-9df7-3d97-a70d-630d93576862",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The human condition or nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c574426e-8ed7-3807-9d10-b8e9a0035370",
                                        "entry_id": "f8d4e27d-9df7-3d97-a70d-630d93576862",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being benevolent; humane traits of character; humane qualities or aspects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8dfb45f-72ff-40c6-a138-2790ae4d17e9",
                                                "sense_id": "c574426e-8ed7-3807-9d10-b8e9a0035370",
                                                "text": "Think of that; by that sweet girl that old man had a child: hold ye then there can be any utter, hopeless harm in Ahab? No, no, my lad; stricken, blasted, if he be, Ahab has his humanities!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91b1d018-eb83-4e66-ad66-ccb2e70c1595",
                                                "sense_id": "c574426e-8ed7-3807-9d10-b8e9a0035370",
                                                "text": "Killing Animals Humanely. Humanity requires that animals be killed in the quickest and least painful manner. The following circular has been sent by our American Humane Education Society very widely through the country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "407f36d1-469b-3993-ad17-55cc5f9ba40c",
                                        "entry_id": "f8d4e27d-9df7-3d97-a70d-630d93576862",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any academic subject belonging to the humanities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0058789-9e20-4e47-b5e6-aeadd9683479",
                                                "sense_id": "407f36d1-469b-3993-ad17-55cc5f9ba40c",
                                                "text": "Philosophy is a humanity while psychology is a science."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd10c120-535f-4d08-9688-9074c9af0a16",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e4371be-b35c-34f1-8407-1f59b6d389a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "f6c8320a-69c5-3aa5-b88f-dd3f5a7e4267",
                        "target_lang_word": "Menschheit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Menschheit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                        "entry_id": "79d6f553-df19-3c87-aebf-1851903fdfc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gesamtheit aller Menschen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a5d002f-7e96-41cc-90fa-f79c1bacba34",
                                                "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                                "text": "Das Problem des Klimawandels betrifft die ganze Menschheit, besonders aber jenen Teil, der in den Entwicklungsländern lebt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "997899d6-13c2-4e55-8158-3352c9e75dd5",
                                                "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                                "text": "„Die Menschheit hat gelernt, dass Schweigen und Ignoranz keine düsteren Realitäten verändern, und dass nur kritisches Denken, freie Rede und offene Kritik zu Fortschritt führen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bec460fc-52c8-4a93-8f92-8e6a93f3f144",
                                                "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                                "text": "„Dies ist ein kleiner Schritt für einen Menschen, aber ein gewaltiger Sprung für die Menschheit.“ (Im engl. Original: „That's one small step for [a] man, one giant leap for mankind.“)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "735d4fa8-3a45-4f53-9faf-40a9b6fd4425",
                                                "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                                "text": "„Wenn überhaupt, dann kann die Menschheit meiner festen Überzeugung nach nur aus Erfahrungen lernen, also aus der Vergangenheit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b789206-62b1-416c-a2ac-9c2a5d23a3d9",
                                                "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                                "text": "„In der Zubereitung von Kaffee machte die Menschheit seitdem rasche Fortschritte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3c3008a-6f5a-41b4-81ec-328e8b6b92b4",
                                                "sense_id": "47907568-eea3-3f15-8dd1-4ac1a58f1c5e",
                                                "text": "„Erst wenn die Mutigen klug und die Klugen mutig geworden sind, wird das zu spüren sein, was irrtümlicherweise schon oft festgestellt wurde: ein Fortschritt der Menschheit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7556c967-46ea-34f6-af75-f746a5b5e479",
                                        "entry_id": "79d6f553-df19-3c87-aebf-1851903fdfc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Menschsein, Wesen des Menschen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "outdated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64c91ca4-f926-4f08-bed5-59a7bcddd111",
                                                "sense_id": "7556c967-46ea-34f6-af75-f746a5b5e479",
                                                "text": "„Kritik richtet Rahner auch an eine traditionelle Theologie, die auf dem Hintergrund monophysitischer Tendenzen die Bedeutung der Menschheit Jesu für das Gottesverhältnis des Menschen nicht genügend berücksichtigt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
